('firefly-millennium-lantern-queen','fish','천년등을 품은 요정여왕','마을 최초의 반딧불이 잠든 천년의 꽃등을 소중히 품은 여왕이에요.','0.18','0.78','0.024',165,'mythic','fish/mythic/firefly-millennium-lantern-queen_v1_thumbnail.png',3500,'fish/mythic/firefly-millennium-lantern-queen_swim8_v1_sprite.png','firefly','swim',true,'both'),
('firefly-village-elder-turtle','fish','여울을 업은 고목거북','고목과 작은 요정 마을을 등에 업고 천천히 여울을 지나는 오랜 수호자예요.','0.18','0.78','0.024',165,'mythic','fish/mythic/firefly-village-elder-turtle_v1_thumbnail.png',3400,'fish/mythic/firefly-village-elder-turtle_swim8_v1_sprite.png','firefly','swim',true,'both'),
('firefly-flower-dream-queen','fish','꽃잠의 요정여왕','수련 꽃봉오리 왕좌에 앉아 꽃들이 편히 잠들도록 밤을 돌보는 여왕이에요.','0.18','0.78','0.024',165,'mythic','fish/mythic/firefly-flower-dream-queen_v1_thumbnail.png',3600,'fish/mythic/firefly-flower-dream-queen_swim8_v1_sprite.png','firefly','swim',true,'both'),
('firefly-first-firefly-spirit','fish','첫반딧불의 정령','여울의 모든 반딧불에게 처음 빛을 나누어 주었다는 오래된 정령이에요.','0.18','0.78','0.024',165,'mythic','fish/mythic/firefly-first-firefly-spirit_v1_thumbnail.png',3100,'fish/mythic/firefly-first-firefly-spirit_swim8_v1_sprite.png','firefly','swim',true,'both')
